---
import { marked } from 'marked';
const { markdown = '', kind = 'learn', title = '' } = Astro.props;
marked.setOptions({ gfm: true, breaks: false });
const html = markdown ? await marked.parse(markdown) : '';
---
<section class={`study-panel markdown-panel ${kind}-panel`} data-panel-body={kind}>
  {markdown ? (
    <article class="markdown-book" set:html={html} />
  ) : (
    <div class="pending-panel">
      <div class="pending-kicker">SOURCE CLOSURE PENDING</div>
      <h2>{title || '内容将在该角色进入批次时接入'}</h2>
      <p>角色入口与 UI 已保留；学习内容不会用旧 fallback 冒充当前 Gold 内容。</p>
    </div>
  )}
</section>
